.TH SCHEMA-REVERSE 1 "2026 April 02" "Qore 2.3" "Qore Programming Language"
.SH NAME
schema\-reverse \- reverse-engineer database schemas to Qore code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B schema\-reverse
\fIoptions\fP
\fIconnection\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBschema\-reverse\fR connects to a database and generates Qore class
definitions representing the database schema.
It supports tables, sequences, views, materialized views, types, functions,
procedures, and packages.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-schema =\fIname\fP
Export the full schema as a Qore class with the given \fIname\fP.
Cannot be combined with specific object options.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-table =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching tables.
\fIpattern\fP can be an exact name, comma-separated list, or regex.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-seq =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching sequences.
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-type =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching types.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-view =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching views.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-mview =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching materialized views.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-proc =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching procedures.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-func =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching functions.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-pkg =\fIpattern\fP
Export matching packages.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help text and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Export the full schema:
.RS
.B schema\-reverse \-s=MySchema oracle:user/pass@mydb
.RE
.PP
Export specific tables (regex pattern):
.RS
.B schema\-reverse \-t="workflows,.*step.*" oracle:user/pass@mydb
.RE
.PP
Export all sequences:
.RS
.B schema\-reverse \-q=".*" pgsql:user/pass@mydb
.RE
